        <!--
            ExecType: the specification table lists 0,4,5,8,9,A,C,D,E,F,G,H,L. Order Status (I)
            is not in that table, but the ExecID (17) description on the same message states
            "Will be 0 if ExecType (150) is Order Status (I)". It is declared here because
